      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Louis Vuitton has just unveiled its latest \"High Summer\" capsule collection, drawing inspiration from the Côte d'Azur and seaside living. The new handbags feature a palette of soft pastels—mint green, quartz, sky blue, and light sand—paired with lightweight materials like striped canvas and raffia-effect weaves, capturing the carefree joy and leisurely spirit of the holidays.",
