      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The new Low Key Hobo bag is crafted from yellow, white, and beige striped canvas, echoing the loungers at seaside resorts. It's trimmed with quartz pink calf leather and features an adjustable shoulder strap with metal side buckles, allowing it to be carried by hand, over the shoulder, or crossbody. The bright, cheerful palette evokes a relaxed, vacation-ready mood.",
      "url": null,
